<title>GREECE: IONIAN BANK OPENS NEW BRANCH IN RETHYMNO.</title>
<headline>IONIAN BANK OPENS NEW BRANCH IN RETHYMNO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank of Greece opened a new branch at Rethymno, Crete, bringing its total branch network to 223, it said.</p>
<p>The new branch offers the full spectrum of banking services and is located at Garazo, Rethymno.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
